# Map assets

- Keep large geography in `maps/*.svg` (`routes.svg`, `wuyue.svg`), not inline in `index.html`.
- Mount points use `data-map="maps/....svg"`; the page script fetches and injects SVG so `.node` / `.inode` tooltips work.
- Do not switch maps to `<img>` — that breaks tooltip DOM access.
- Serve over HTTP (`npx serve .` / Vercel). `file://` cannot fetch the maps.
- Leave dense path `d` attributes compact; edit labels/nodes in the SVG files, styles/copy in `index.html`.
